<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization — Model fidelity to source: 62/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Lewis's (2003) single-cell her1/her7 autoinhibitory DDEs and Box 1 period rule T_osc = 2*(T_m + T_p + ln(2)/b + ln(2)/c) (L115-260), but Pass 1 lacks the exact characteristic-root Hopf threshold T_crit, verification of delay-split invariance (T_m - delta, T_p + delta), and the 32-cell stochastic DeltaC-Notch phase-locking simulator reproducing the 6 intact anterior somites of bea/des/aei." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py L305–L395: Multicellular DeltaC-Notch PSM synchronization vs bea/des/aei desynchronization simulator <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py#L305-L395>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

