<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization — MorphoEval overall 58.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py` (58.9/100). The initial baseline captures the single-cell her1/her7 delay differential equations dp/dt = a m(t - T_p) - b p(t) and dm/dt = k / (1 + (p(t - T_m)/p_0)^n) - c m(t) with oscillation period T_osc ~ 30 min at 28 C, but requires exact characteristic-equation Hopf bifurcation threshold calculation (T_crit = 7.54 min), verification of total delay invariance T_tot = T_m + T_p, explicit modeling of Notch mutant (bea/des/aei) stochastic desynchronization after the first 5-7 anterior somites alongside intron-deletion and cycloheximide ablation controls, and bilateral dorsal somite segmentation against the vendored vertebrate embryo SEM specimen (`zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg`). Overall 58.5/100 (faithfulness 56.7, reproducibility 62.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 53, Parameter expressivity 58, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_comparison.png: rendered output of 2003-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1297780 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073 (sha256 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073), spec_fingerprint aac320679fac08d48974a97790e40f0dc67f5f375d8c0e064bf33e9bb39965c7. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: aac320679fac08d48974a97790e40f0dc67f5f375d8c0e064bf33e9bb39965c7; artifact_sha256: 0e1ad609466f9bb60c1a445eb6803998bd157f8317975fa758496ed2cb2aa073; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator_reference.json=5c4993acb1c42c84..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/scout_manifest.json=ebe3f2cee38772dd..., datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak & inter-somitic cleft segmentation on `datasets/her1_her7_delayed_oscillator/zebrafish_somites_specimen.jpg` with phase-aligned Pearson r correlation.",
        "remediation needed: Compute exact characteristic-equation Hopf bifurcation delay T_crit = 7.54 min and verify numerical DDE period invariance under redistributing delay (T_m - delta, T_p + delta) alongside subcritical (T_tot = 2.0 min < T_crit) and cycloheximide (a = 0) negative controls.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate a 32-cell stochastic PSM oscillator ensemble demonstrating wild-type DeltaC-Notch phase locking (R_sync > 0.95) vs bea/des/aei mutant desynchronization after 6 intact anterior somites." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.85e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lewis-her1-her7-delayed-oscillator-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) zebrafish her1/her7 autoinhibitory delay differential oscillator and DeltaC-Notch synchronization — Parameter expressivity: 58/100" ;
